From 5efc7e2b2ca9f41a832e46748ef4cdbfc238612b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Sam Day <me@samcday.com>
Date: Fri, 11 Sep 2026 09:31:00 +1000
Subject: [PATCH 3/4] misc: add Sargo fingerprint reset and IRQ companion

Describe the stock GPIO 134 reset and GPIO 121 IRQ wiring and reset sequence. Expose an exclusive misc device with an IRQ counter, current-level snapshot, reset, and opt-in wakeup controls. Keep open file descriptors safe across device removal. Sensor commands and matching stay in the trusted application.

